  "invariants": [
    "UI never owns authoritative run state.",
    "RunSession is the source of truth for an active run.",
    "Content Registry is immutable and versioned during a run.",
    "XP drops and aftermath items are separate entity types.",
    "Clock advances in RUN_ACTIVE, BOSS_INTRO and BOSS_ACTIVE for every boss; it freezes in offer, pause, settlement and terminal/transaction states.",
    "Final victory requires authoritative final boss defeat.",
    "Rewards are committed atomically with the corresponding wallet/unlock revision.",
    "Unknown numeric values remain pending until confirmed by B1.",
    "Unknown product rules remain pending until confirmed by the product owner.",
    "Missing resource errors produce diagnostics, never a blank screen.",
    "Final boss settlement creates no chest_offer and transitions to victory after ledger commit.",
    "Non-final boss-chest, artifact-offer and result effects are idempotent.",
    "A boss chest is only a non-final checkpoint synergy/evolution/fallback offer; the final boss never creates one.",
    "Every artifact offer contains exactly three candidates and one chosen candidate becomes one active run effect.",
    "Active artifacts have no fixed run capacity and do not consume weapon or passive slots.",
    "Artifact effects use typed contracts separate from ordinary passive modifiers.",
    "The first-clear artifact offer is a separate post-result reward boundary, not a final boss chest.",
    "The target run duration is 1800 seconds; the terminal encounter is the only final slot.",
    "There are six main-boss records, three intermediate-boss records and up to fifteen chest windows; counts do not make runtime content implemented.",
    "Every non-final encounter enters post-boss relief before the next wave ramp; no direct post-boss jump to peak is allowed without an explicit B1 profile.",
    "Enemy variants are deterministic records under a base enemy and preserve XP/aftermath/reward boundaries unless B1 explicitly overrides them.",
    "The three beetle variants require a non-color visual marker and do not consume additional synergy/chest claims.",
    "Legacy v1 snapshots cannot be silently reinterpreted as v2 30-minute runs."
